load @term/seed/code/manifold/riemannian
  find riemannian-manifold

# A vector differential operator: an operator that differentiates fields on a manifold, the gradient (slope of a scalar),
# the divergence (outflow of a vector), and the curl (rotation of a vector), all assembled from partial derivatives. They
# are the vocabulary of the field equations of physics. The form carries the manifold the fields live on.
form vector-differential-operator
  link manifold, like riemannian-manifold
